/* --- Accessibility: OS-first contrast + motion --- */

/*
 * Reduced motion (SC 2.3.3): OS `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` always wins;
 * `html.reduce-motion` forces the same rules when the in-app toggle is on.
 *
 * Do NOT set global `*` `animation-duration` / `transition-duration` — Radix
 * Presence and vaul wait for animationend/transitionend and can leave overlays
 * stuck invisible/unmounted. Target overlays with `animation: none` so Presence
 * completes immediately, and only kill decorative motion elsewhere.
 */
